Emerging Market Opportunities
Localization of Battery Manufacturing
Automakers are seeking battery supply closer to vehicle assembly operations to improve logistics and supply-chain resilience. Localized manufacturing facilities and regional supply agreements create opportunities for cylindrical cell producers with the technical and financial resources to establish qualified production.

Development of Advanced Cell Formats and Chemistries
Large cylindrical formats and improvements in cathode chemistry provide opportunities to enhance battery performance and vehicle integration. Suppliers developing high-quality 46-series cells and differentiated nickel-rich chemistries can target new electric vehicle platforms and long-term procurement contracts.

